# Function parameter shadows outer dict binding
# x=42 in the outer dict, but the fn parameter named x shadows it.
# [call [fn [x] [* $x 2]] 10] calls the function with x=10,
# so $x inside the function body is 10, not 42.
[
  x: 42
  result: [call [fn [let x] [* $x 2]] 10]
]
=== out
Dict({"x": Int(42), "result": Int(20)})
